<title>USA: Coventry to get $40 mln Warburg financing.</title>
<headline>Coventry to get $40 mln Warburg financing.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry  Corp said on Monday it has signed a letter of intent in which Warburg, Pincus Ventures LP will buy $40 million of Conventry's convertible exchangeable subordinated notes.</p>
<p>The proposed deal will also include warrants to buy 2.35 million of its common shares, Coventry said. The notes would be convertible into 4.0 million of its common shares, it added.</p>
</text>
